doc:aekfosElmConfiguration opmad:has_text_value "The network is an ensemble of KFOS-ELM individuals. KF iteratively estimates individual weight coefficients according to output estimation accuracy as new data chunks arrive. Process noise gamma is neglected, and coefficient changes are driven by state covariance minimization." .
