	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:9cc316e193c1 .
doc:kfosElmConfiguration opmad:has_text_value "KF estimates OS-ELM output weights without changing the network structure. Learning proceeds chunk-by-chunk. Initialization follows plain OS-ELM, using a small data chunk to compute the initial hidden-layer output matrix and output weights; initial variance P and observation-noise covariance R are also supplied. Output weights are KF state variables updated with each new data chunk. Training minimizes the trace of the output-weight error covariance with respect to the Kalman gain. R is nonnegative definite. Training finishes after the specified number of chunks, retaining the last updated output weights as the final network parameters." .
_:e0c357a2d73317f6589c075739b32dbc rdf:reifies <<( doc:kfosElmConfiguration opmad:has_text_value "KF estimates OS-ELM output weights without changing the network structure. Learning proceeds chunk-by-chunk. Initialization follows plain OS-ELM, using a small data chunk to compute the initial hidden-layer output matrix and output weights; initial variance P and observation-noise covariance R are also supplied. Output weights are KF state variables updated with each new data chunk. Training minimizes the trace of the output-weight error covariance with respect to the Kalman gain. R is nonnegative definite. Training finishes after the specified number of chunks, retaining the last updated output weights as the final network parameters." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:9cc316e193c1 .
doc:osElmConfiguration opmad:has_text_value "The input weights and hidden-layer bias of plain OS-ELM are initialized randomly." .
_:c445f62a2ac7ed5d2fddc92ee0d6cb1e rdf:reifies <<( doc:osElmConfiguration opmad:has_text_value "The input weights and hidden-layer bias of plain OS-ELM are initialized randomly." )>> ;
